{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 3, "text": "在布依族古谢仪式中，有一个礼仪——祭灵，必须由死者的女婿", "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 537, "w": 1132, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "在布依族古谢仪式中，有一个礼仪——祭灵，必须由死者的女婿", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 537, "w": 1132, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 4, "text": "来亲自敬祭。故有专用的祭词——穆揆，即祭灵经，也可译为姑爷祭", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 597, "w": 1211, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来亲自敬祭。故有专用的祭词——穆揆，即祭灵经，也可译为姑爷祭", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 597, "w": 1211, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 5, "text": "灵歌。这种歌一般由祭方找歌师（经师）来唸唱。如祭方无此能力，", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 655, "w": 1195, "h": 64}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "灵歌。这种歌一般由祭方找歌师（经师）来唸唱。如祭方无此能力，", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 655, "w": 1195, "h": 64}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 6, "text": "也可请主家的歌师或助手来代唸，但须有一定礼品酬谢。", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 719, "w": 998, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "也可请主家的歌师或助手来代唸，但须有一定礼品酬谢。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 719, "w": 998, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 7, "text": "祭灵，主要表现姑爷对岳父（母）的一片虔诚之心，因而它的歌", "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 778, "w": 1132, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祭灵，主要表现姑爷对岳父（母）的一片虔诚之心，因而它的歌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 778, "w": 1132, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 8, "text": "词基调是谦逊，赤诚，恭敬。当然其中也叙述了特有的习俗和民族的", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 837, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "词基调是谦逊，赤诚，恭敬。当然其中也叙述了特有的习俗和民族的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 837, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 9, "text": "特殊风范，亦叙述了布依族对生老死葬的种种看法和创家立业的艰", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 900, "w": 1208, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "特殊风范，亦叙述了布依族对生老死葬的种种看法和创家立业的艰", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 900, "w": 1208, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 10, "text": "辛，故又有些与其它卷有重复，但各自的用意不同，各有特色。", "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 959, "w": 1116, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "辛，故又有些与其它卷有重复，但各自的用意不同，各有特色。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 168, "y": 959, "w": 1116, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_guxiejing", "page": 290, "line_no": 11, "text": "祭灵经唱完后，古谢也就结束了。故它也很引人注目。", "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 1019, "w": 955, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祭灵经唱完后，古谢也就结束了。故它也很引人注目。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 247, "y": 1019, "w": 955, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.4-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
